    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) convened community health promoters and healthcare workers in Kaloleni, Kilifi County, on February 12, 2026, to share findings from a new study examining whether digital platforms can effectively deliver mental health support to young people in Kenya.",
